m is a Crystal CLI.

Mitamae recipe commands:
  execute-mitamae-recipe       Fuzzy-select and execute a recipe with fzf.
  execute-mitamae-recipe-at    Execute a recipe, recipe directory, or .list file.
  list-mitamae-recipes         Print all paths offered by the recipe picker.

Recipes are read from ~/recipes for root. For other users, ~/user.recipes
is preferred when it exists; otherwise ~/recipes is used.

Recipe execution uses:
  mitamae local --node-yaml ~/.config/recipes/node.yml PATH

The picker requires fzf. Recipe execution requires mitamae.
